WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.069
everybody.
You're here.

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.203
You made it. You're watching.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:07.039
Thank you for watching.

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:09.241
Well, guys, last night,
President Biden announced

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:13.613
new vaccine mandates that could
apply to 100 million Americans

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.448 size:88% position:44% line:0%
and he told the unvaccinated

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:18.718 line:0%
that his patience
is wearing thin.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.920
Yeah. Apparently,
Biden's new speechwriter

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.222
used to be
a substitute teacher.

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:23.623
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:26.259
"Hey, my patience
is running thin.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:27.594
You want me
to continue this movie?"

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.895
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:32.332
Yep, Biden says his patience
is wearing thin.

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.133
Asked how thin, Biden said,

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.534
"Somewhere between paper

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:36.669
and the new Kim Jong-un.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.671
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:41.941
Yep, Biden outlined his plan
to boost vaccinations

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.611
among federal workers
and private employees.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.911
And, if that doesn't work,
he's just going

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:48.047
to slip the vaccine
in every pumpkin spice latte,

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.248
[ Laughter ]
so I think that'll work.

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:50.883
[ Applause ]
That's a good idea.

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:52.118
Speaking of vaccines --

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.953
