they're working

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:58.457
on a single shot that's a COVID
booster and a flu shot.

00:00:58.457 --> 00:01:00.893
[ Murmuring ]

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.195
Americans heard and were like,

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.697
"Throw in some dewormer,
and you got yourself a deal.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:09.068
[ Laughter and applause ]
Now, we'll talk."

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:12.238
That's right,
COVID vaccine-flu shot combo.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.306
Not to be outdone,

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:15.241
Johnson &amp; Johnson
just released their...

00:01:16.975 --> 00:01:20.513 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.615
No tears.

00:01:22.681 --> 00:01:24.216
No tears.

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:25.685
